---
title: Complex Zolto Fixture — Phase 10
version: 10.0.0
---

@var engine = Zolto
@var phase  = 10

# {{engine}} Phase {{phase}} — Full Feature Fixture {#top}

> [!NOTE]
> This fixture exercises all Phase 1–10 constructs in one document.

@layout width=100% padding=16 gap=12 theme="dark"
  @grid columns=12 gap=12
    @cell span=6
      @chart bar title="Performance Metrics"
      labels: Parse Validate Render
      data: 12 5 18
      @/chart
    @/cell
    @cell span=6
      @vector width=360 height=180 theme="dark"
      rect x=10 y=10 w=340 h=160 radius=12 fill="#1e2330" stroke="#334155"
      circle cx=60 cy=60 r=24 fill="#6366f1"
      text x=100 y=65 size=18 fill="#ffffff"
        Vector Graphics
      @endtext
      @/vector
    @/cell
  @/grid
@/layout

@diagram flowchart title="Engine Execution Flow"
Input -> Lexer -> Parser -> Validator -> Renderer -> Output
@/diagram

@math label="eq:relativity"
E = m c^2
@/math

component FeatureBadge(label!, tone="primary")
badge tone=tone
{label}
end
end

FeatureBadge(label="Phase 10 Active", tone="success")

@form quickCheck {
  @text username required
  label "Username"
  @button primary "Submit"
}

@quiz "Quick Quiz" {
  @truefalse "Zolto supports native math, diagrams, charts, vectors, layouts, components, and interactive widgets."
  answer true
}

[info title="Combined Test"]
Testing **bold**, *italic*, ==highlight==, ^sup^, ~sub~, [[Ctrl+K]] inside an admonition.
[/info]

[theorem]
For every valid CommonMark document $D$, $D$ is also a valid Zolto document.
[/theorem]

Reference: see [the spec][spec] and Equation @ref(eq:relativity).

[spec]: https://zolto.dev/spec "Zolto Specification"

